    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:birkhot_hashachar/shetatzileni" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n36.jpg">
        <tei:pb ed="1965" n="7" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n36.jpg"/>
        <tei:p>May it be Thy will, O Lord my God and God of my fathers, to save me today and everyday from the impudent and from impudence, from evil men, from evil companions, from evil neighbours, from evil encounters, from Satan the destroyer, from a harsh verdict and from a harsh opponent, whether Jew or non-Jew. </tei:p>
      </tei:div>
